  "system": {
    "description": "<p>A calling for one who, by iron alone, would conquer all. </p><p></p><p>In troubled times, few things offer more comfort than the weight of a blade in hand. The arms and armor that have kept you alive thus far now welcome you down a path of study. They invite you to earn your place as their worthy master, offer to rend apart those who have wronged you, entreat you to free the world of its corrupted denizens.</p><p></p><p>You see the truth, that your weapons are more than mere metal- they are tools to build the future of this land. In your practiced hand, their deadliness may be enough to surpass the sorcery of the learned, the treachery of the cunning, and the ferocious hunger of the beastly. These qualities will avail your foes little when your iron seeks the redness of blood! Let each fresh conquest kindle your ambition, but always bear in mind: many more die by the sword than live by it.</p>",
